{%- comment -%}
  About — one band of the OW Landing page, split out of
  sections/ow-landing.liquid when that section moved to theme blocks so the
  products band could own its cards as real children. The origin story plus a
  swipeable carousel of cards.

  Like ow-products, this block holds only the band's chrome: the story column
  and the carousel scaffolding. The cards themselves are ow-about-card children
  rendered by {% content_for 'blocks' %} straight into .about-cards-track, so
  the merchant adds as many as the story needs and can reorder them.
  ow-about-card is not offered at section level, only inside here, which is what
  keeps a stray card from landing elsewhere on the page.

  Eight cards is the intended ceiling, but it is advisory only and lives in the
  schema paragraph, not in code. A theme block's schema accepts exactly six
  attributes — name, settings, blocks, presets, tag, class — so neither
  `max_blocks` (a section-only key) nor a per-type `limit` is allowed here, and
  both fail theme-check with ValidSchema. Nothing in the layout breaks past
  eight; the track just keeps scrolling. If the ceiling ever needs teeth, the
  only lever is hiding the overflow in CSS, which makes cards silently vanish
  in the editor and is worse than the advice.

  Layout lives in assets/ow-landing.css and behaviour in assets/ow-landing.js;
  both key off the class names and ids in this markup, so do not rename them.
{%- endcomment -%}

<section class="about" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="about-story">
    <h3 class="fade-up h3">{{ block.settings.heading }}</h3>
    <p class="fade-up paragraph">{{ block.settings.body }}</p>
    <a href="{{ block.settings.cta_link | default: '#' }}" class="btn-outline fade-up">{{ block.settings.cta_text }}</a>
  </div>
  <div class="about-cards-carousel">
    <div class="about-cards-wrap" id="aboutCardsWrap" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="About carousel — swipe or use arrow keys to browse">
      <div class="about-cards-track">
        {% content_for 'blocks' %}
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="scroll-fade scroll-fade-left hide" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="scroll-fade scroll-fade-right" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "About",
  "blocks": [{ "type": "ow-about-card" }],
  "settings": [
    { "type": "paragraph", "content": "Add an About Card to this band for each beat of the story, up to 8. They scroll horizontally." },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "heading",
      "label": "Heading",
      "default": "Omawild began during an expedition across Bali when we plunged our entire life savings into conservation"
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "body",
      "label": "Body",
      "default": "Until we went broke and realised nature needed a better business model..."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "cta_text",
      "label": "Button text",
      "default": "Follow our rabbit hole"
    },
    {
      "type": "url",
      "id": "cta_link",
      "label": "Button link"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
